    "summary": "Added groupSubsystems (src/indexer/subsystems.ts), a pure, deterministic Louvain-style modularity grouping of a file graph. Local moves visit nodes in path order, and a tie within 1e-12 goes to the smaller group. Aggregation numbers groups by their first member and repeats until nothing moves. There is no randomness. Ids are the sha256 of the sorted members (hex-32); names are the longest common directory, or the file's own path for a single file. Connections sum relationship edges and their kind counts, following edge direction, and leave out the kind-less same-directory edges. directoryEdges builds those 0.1 same-directory edges for the pass to use.",
